  "body": "  <p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6538951e-7da7-44e3-aa6b-169ef7d3fc9c.png\" alt=\"Titled\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" /></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>BWG: Retro Edition</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>What is this?</strong></h2>\n<p><em><strong>This texture pack reintroduces the original assets from BYG into the modern version of the mod BWG. Carefully curated by AOCAWOL, our lead creative director and artist! Note that blocks that are original to BWG, such as Ironwood and more, do not have texture changes for now! But I might go in and redo them all in the future if there is a demand for it!</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Want BWG in your vanilla worlds?</strong></em></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #99cc00;\"><em><strong>Download Oh The Textures We've Got for 1.21.1+!</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/oh-the-textures-weve-got\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><em><strong>CLICK HERE</strong></em></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wayfinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_e8d4324a-6bc2-4fa8-9669-910de9b683a7.png\" alt=\"Wayfinder\" width=\"823\" height=\"388\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/aocawol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cce93a0d-9721-4764-924b-1439022c7aba.png\" alt=\"Bisect\" width=\"616\" hei